Z||000000||Msaby||12-27-2001||09:54 AM||||I have a fiero that is missing the ac comp.  and hoses.  the car is an 84 4sp. my question is what comp and hoses will fit.  i am currently installing an Archie kit and i would like to connect the ac.  any suggestions or advise would be appreciated.<BR>thanks||||reg||5
Z||000001||FieroJoe||12-27-2001||11:11 AM||||I think that all AC hoses are the same, at least the one that came with my V6 I just bought and the one on my 87 2.5L look the same.  84's might be different, though, and they changed them after 84 because of the recall...||||reg||1
Z||000002||Rodrv6||12-27-2001||11:31 AM||||The 84 hoses are different from all the rest. (Of course!)  The Fiero Store has them--they may be available through a good auto parts store.  The compressor on the 84's was the DA-6 and is the same as the later years except for the ones that used the V5.<P>------------------<BR>Rod Schneider, Woodstock, Ga.  <BR>White 88 GT :)||||reg||1
